OL,3,GNEWSALara Croft statue arrives in city
OL,4,Aahead of installation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 9ft (2.7m) statue of Tomb Raider hero
OL,7,FLara Croft has arrived at a temporary
OL,8,Fsite in her home city of Derby ahead of
OL,9,Fits permanent installation.
OL,11,FThe sculpture formed part of the Tomb
OL,12,FRaider: The LIVE Experience in Camden
OL,13,FMarket in London but has been in
OL,14,Fstorage since the attraction closed in
OL,15,F2023.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
